{
  "name": "Daily Competitor Pricing & OpenAPI Breaking-Change Alerts (Noise-Free Semantic Diff)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Noise-Free Competitor Pricing & API Diff Monitor\n\nRuns daily via **Apify (`lu-tools/saas-pricing-api-diff-monitor`)** using persistent Key-Value snapshots.\n\n- Ignores CSS/banner/timestamp noise\n- Flags price changes & removed OpenAPI endpoints as **`BREAKING`**\n- Outputs nothing when `UNCHANGED` (`onlyPushChanges: true`)\n\n### Setup (60 seconds)\n1. Set Header Auth on **Run Semantic Diff Monitor** (`Authorization: Bearer YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN`).\n2. Put your competitors' pricing URLs, OpenAPI JSON URLs, or RSS changelogs into `targets`.\n3. Connect the **True** branch to Slack, Email, or Notion.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "sticky-diff-setup",
      "name": "Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [180, 40]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [{ "field": "days", "daysInterval": 1 }]
        }
      },
      "id": "schedule-daily",
      "name": "Daily Schedule Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [220, 400]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/lu-tools~saas-pricing-api-diff-monitor/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\n  \"targets\": [\n    { \"url\": \"https://apify.com/pricing\", \"monitorType\": \"pricing\", \"label\": \"Apify Pricing\" },\n    { \"url\": \"https://petstore3.swagger.io/api/v3/openapi.json\", \"monitorType\": \"openapi\", \"label\": \"Partner OpenAPI\" },\n    { \"url\": \"https://linear.app/changelog\", \"monitorType\": \"changelog\", \"label\": \"Linear Changelog\" }\n  ],\n  \"stateStoreName\": \"my-competitor-diff-store\",\n  \"onlyPushChanges\": true,\n  \"compactMode\": true\n}",
        "options": { "timeout": 60000 }
      },
      "id": "apify-diff-run",
      "name": "Run Semantic Diff Monitor",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [500, 400]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "typeValidation": "strict" },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "is-changed",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.changed }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": { "type": "boolean", "operation": "equals" }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      },
      "id": "filter-real-changes",
      "name": "Only Real Semantic Changes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [780, 400]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Daily Schedule Trigger": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Run Semantic Diff Monitor", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Run Semantic Diff Monitor": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Only Real Semantic Changes", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    }
  },
  "settings": { "executionOrder": "v1" }
}
